  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Jouhouzia 2: safeguarding cultural heritage in crisis situation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Impact: contribute to cultural property protection through building the capacity and enabling the Lebanese authorities and professionals responsible for heritage safeguarding.
Outcome 1: LAF and ministry of culture are provided with knowledge, skills and resources on Cultural Emergency Response for heritage safeguarding. Outcome 2: Hands on support and coaching to Lebanese authorities to document heritage situation in times of crisis for better safeguarding.Outcome 3: Exchange of knowledge and information on regional and international level in relation to Cultural Emergency Response and the fight against the illicit trafficking of cultural properties.</narrative>
  </description>
